# ============================================================
# Terraform
# ============================================================

# Terraform working directory
**/.terraform/

# Terraform state files
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*

# Terraform crash logs
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

# Terraform variable files containing secrets
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json

# Terraform override files
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json


